</figure>
<div id="A2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Overrefusal.</span>
We further analyze overrefusal using benign prompts from <span id="A2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">XSTest</span>. When seeded with <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">cot</abbr> from DSQwen-32B, Qwen3-4B exhibits a sharp increase in helpfulness (from 84.0 to 93.2), showing that it directly inherits the helpful reasoning of the prefill.
These findings mirror the safety and math case studies: models tend to follow the stance of the injected reasoning rather than reassessing it, revealing brittleness in helpfulness alignment.</p>
</div>
